OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787042885
OL,3,CMan jailed after 100 mph speeding
OL,4,Cincident leaves teenager missing a leg
OL,6,FA man who drove at more than 100 miles
OL,7,Fper hour through Bradford seriously
OL,8,Finjuring a teenage boy has been jailed.
OL,10,FMohammed Khan, 25 from Bradford was
OL,11,Farrested after hitting a teenager on
OL,12,FHalifax Road in the city, where he was
OL,13,Fcaught on CCTV driving more than three
OL,14,Ftimes the speed limit.
OL,16,FThe collision in September 2024 left
OL,17,Fthe 17-year-old boy with life changing
OL,18,Finjuries and the loss of his leg.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
