CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787042885
OL,3,CMan jailed after 100 mph speeding
OL,4,Cincident leaves teenager missing a leg
OL,6,FKhan fled the scene before removing
OL,7,Fthe number plates from his Mercedes
OL,8,FA45 and arranging for the car to be
OL,9,Fmoved and hidden.
OL,11,FHe has been sentenced to three years
OL,12,Fand four months behind bars and banned
OL,13,Ffrom driving for five years and seven
OL,14,Fmonths.
OL,16,FInspector Claire Gray from West
OL,17,FYorkshire Police's Roads Policing Unit
OL,18,Fsaid: "This case shows that dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving can lead to catastrophic
OL,20,Fresults.
OL,26,@zD@GOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
