OL,3,CMan jailed after 100 mph speeding
OL,4,Cincident leaves teenager missing a leg
OL,6,F"People need to understand that speed
OL,7,Flimits are there for everyone's safety
OL,8,Fand to blatantly ignore this is
OL,9,Funacceptable.
OL,11,F"Our Roads Policing officers are
OL,12,Fcommitted to identifying and taking
OL,13,Faction against those who put
OL,14,Fthemselves and other road users at
OL,15,Frisk.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
